<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1372_4787.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ernveste</unclear>, fürsichtige, ersame und weise. E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="2"/>seyen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gutwillig</unclear> dienst zuvor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>liebe herrn und freundt. Uns haben diser tagen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> mitburger, herr <persName resp="#ner">Mathias <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Püchler</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burger</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/>maister, und seine <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebruedere</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitverwandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwerungs</unclear> weis angezaigt, wie das e. e. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitburger</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Davidt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikhofer</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weilundt</unclear> ires brueders <persName resp="#ner">Sigmundt
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Püchlers</unclear></persName> seeligen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weib</unclear> und kinder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> der <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wolfskheul</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wonhafft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> und von wegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ainer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> durch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">irem</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>bruedern <persName resp="#ner">Peter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Püchlern</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-21" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nüernberg</unclear></placeName> (alls
<lb n="11"/>welcher ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeittlang</unclear> sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zollikhofers</unclear> factor gewest)
<lb n="12"/>vermainten habenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sprach</unclear> halber, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kauffhaß</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schuldt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbefuegter</unclear> weis habe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verarrestieren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/>so doch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> brueders seeligen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weib</unclear> und kinder,
<lb n="15"/>wie auch sie die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Püchler</unclear> (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußerhalb</unclear> gedachtes <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> brued
<lb n="16"/>Peters) mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zollikhofer</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> zeit weder wenig
<lb n="17"/>noch vil zuthun, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darfur</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemelter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> brueder Peter
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikhofer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear> sich selbsten, und nit in aller
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Püchler</unclear> namen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gefactoriert</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> umb sein an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sprach</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuegsamb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geseßen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habhafft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehr</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Peter
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Püchler</unclear></persName> mit inen den andern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Püchlern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesellschafft</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>gar nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">interessiert</unclear>, sonder auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebürende</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">belohnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> factor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-21" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nürnberg</unclear></placeName> seye etc. Und uns
<lb n="24"/>darauf an e. e. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. wegen relaxierung und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßierung</unclear>,
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbefuegten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">arrests</unclear> umb unser intercession und
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">furschrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vleißig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebetten</unclear>, die wir inen burgerlicher
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwandtnus</unclear> und der billichait wegen nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwaigern</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollen</unclear> noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelangt</unclear> derowegen an e. e. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="29"/>unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlichs</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleißigs</unclear> bitten, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merermelten</unclear> iren burger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Davidt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikofern</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1372_4788.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/>von solchem seinem, wider alle recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbefuegdten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für=</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>=nemen, ab: und dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeweisen</unclear>, da er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">je</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merberuerten</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><persName resp="#ner">Peter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buechlern</unclear></persName>, spruch und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorderrung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerlaßen</unclear> nit
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaindt</unclear>, das er denselbigen vor seinem ordenlichen Ge=
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">=richtstab</unclear>, an orten und enden sich gebürt, darumben
<lb n="36"/>ersuoche, und gedachts <persName resp="#ner">Sigmundt Buechlers</persName> seeligen erben,
<lb n="37"/>wie auch die andern mitverwandte Buechler, deßwegen
<lb n="38"/>rhuobig unbeckumbert und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unangefochten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laße</unclear>, und auch
<lb n="39"/>den angelegten unbefuegdten arrest widerrumben relaxiert
<lb n="40"/>und ledig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sehe</unclear>, im fahl er aber von solchem seinem nichtig
<lb n="41"/>beginnen, nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abstehen</unclear> wolte, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> E. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. in crafft
<lb n="42"/>ires dragenden oberckeithlichen ambts, ine darzuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuover=</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>=mögen und solchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtigen</unclear> arrest <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzuolösen</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="44"/>zuo cassieren dienstlich gebetten sein, und sich hierinnen
<lb n="45"/>so günstig und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willfährig</unclear> erweisen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> denselbigen
<lb n="46"/>unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndertzweifelt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparlichs</unclear> vertrawen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steth</unclear>, und
<lb n="47"/>damit sie die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buechlerischen</unclear>, diser unser geringfuegen (doch
<lb n="48"/>von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billicheit</unclear> wegen wolmainenden) fürschrifft, im werckh
<lb n="49"/>genoßen zuohaben spüren und sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berhuomen</unclear> mögen.
<lb n="50"/>Das alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seien</unclear> umb E. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. und die ihrigen, wir in gleich
<lb n="51"/>und mererm, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> allen begebenden fählen, hinwider freündt
<lb n="52"/>und nachparlichen zuverdienen gantz genaigt willig und er=
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">=biettig</unclear>, datum den <origDate when="1600-02-03" resp="#ner">3. februarij. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">a°</unclear>. 1600 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">J</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="54"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rath</unclear>
<lb n="55"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Isnij</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1372_4789.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1372_4790.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="56"/>Den erenvesten, fürsichtigen, ersamen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>herrn <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rathe</unclear> der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="58"/>unsern besonders lieben herrn und guetten freünden.
<lb n="59"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanct Gallen</placeName>.
</p>
